<title>FINLAND: Finnish Jan jobless rate falls to 18.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Finnish Jan jobless rate falls to 18.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finland's jobless rate fell to 18.5 percent in January from 19.0 percent in December, the Labour Ministry said in its monthly employment survey on Friday.</p>
<p>			Jan 1997    Dec 1996	Jan 1996</p>
<p>    Unemployed     453,300     467,984	 471,531</p>
<p>    Jobless rate    18.5	  19.0	    19.4</p>
<p>The mean of six economists' forecasts for the January jobless rate measured by the labour ministry was 18.6 percent (range 18.5-18.8 pct). The ministry's data is not used in international comparisons.</p>
</text>
